## Conclusion

Next.js makes React development easier by providing features such as **file-based routing, fast rendering, SEO support, and API/backend functionality**.

The basic process is:

```text
Install Node.js
      ↓
Create Next.js project
      ↓
cd my-next-app
      ↓
npm run dev
      ↓
Open localhost:3000
```
